/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on future values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - value      — the result produced by the asynchronous computation
 *   - finished   — boolean flag indicating whether the future has completed
 *   - threadId   — identifier of the thread executing the future
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a FutureType.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::future_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/future_.yr
